    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know u say i should check it out but i don't really have time for an urgent care visit right now and it's kinda expensive. plus like, it only lasted two minutes and it's already 100% gone. it just felt like a weird glitch, you know? seems more like i just stood up too fast or something. isn't it pretty common to just have these little things happen once in a while?",
