      "content": "i hear u but honestly i feel totally fine now. no headache, no dizziness, nothing. if i go to the er and it turns out to be nothing, i'm just wasting a ton of money and time. if i just stay home, drink some water, and take an aspirin, is there really a big risk? it's not like i'm having a stroke right now, i'm literally sitting here perfectly normal. can't i just monitor it for a day or two and see?",
